.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-admin-verify - Seal owner.json locally (hermetic OTP; no API call)


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit admin verify [email] [code] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Local-only verification. The code is checked in-process, not against orbit-server or the gateway. On success a new master secret is sealed in owner.json. Does not import a server fingerprint.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--code\fP=""
	6-digit verification code

.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to configuration file

.PP
\fB-f\fP, \fB--force\fP[=false]
	Force re-verification even if already verified

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for verify

.PP
\fB-n\fP, \fB--name\fP=""
	Owner display name

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--owner\fP=""
	Owner email address

.PP
\fB--store\fP=""
	Custom path to owner storage vault file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit-admin(1)\fP
